<p>This cookie policy explains how the Emergency Preparedness website uses cookies.</p>

<h2>What are cookies?</h2>

<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember information about your visit.</p>

<h2>Cookies we use</h2>

<p>This website does not use any cookies. We do not collect analytics data, track your browsing, or store any information on your device.</p>

<h2>Third-party cookies</h2>

<p>We do not use any third-party services that set cookies on this website.</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>

<p>If you have any questions about how we use cookies, contact HM Government of Gibraltar:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email: <a href="mailto:pressoffice@gibraltar.gov.gi">pressoffice@gibraltar.gov.gi</a></li>
</ul>

